1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,600
Soldiers of Vietnam, we go forward

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,600
with the heart to save the nation,

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:14,000
Our hurried steps sound on the long and arduous road.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Our flag, red with the blood of victory, bears the spirit of our country,

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,900
The distant rumbling of gunfire mingles with our marching song.

6
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:31,000
The path to glory is built upon the bodies of our foes,

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Overcoming all hardships, together we build our resistance bases.

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:42,200
Ceaselessly for the people's cause we struggle

9
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:46,600
Hasten to the battlefield,

10
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:49,800
Advance!

11
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:54,000
All advance!

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Our Vietnam is eternally strong!